# The names of the choices in their pick lists: an item's status,
# condition and works state in the item form, and the status and works
# filters of the search.
T ADMIN
K ENTER
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-I
T I
K CTRL-E TAB F4
S STATPICK
K ESC TAB TAB F4
S CONDPICK
K ESC TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB F4
S WORKPICK
K ESC ESC CTRL-F TAB TAB TAB TAB TAB F4
S SRCHSTAT
K ESC PGDN F4
S SRCHWORK
K ESC ESC
K F3
T Y
